{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2615 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Istikan Chai</strong>, a heartwarming and fast-paced simulation game that celebrates the charm of Middle Eastern street life. You play as a cheerful <strong>ChaiChe</strong>, brewing and serving fragrant tea to a stream of lively customers in colorful bazaar settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a new rush \u2014 drag, pour, and serve before your customers lose patience! As you earn coins, upgrade your cart, unlock stylish tea sets, and decorate your stand with authentic Middle Eastern flair. From the morning markets to the glowing night souks, every location is hand-crafted to capture the warmth, chaos, and rhythm of real street chai culture.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve &amp; Satisfy:</strong> Master quick, intuitive drag-and-drop controls to prepare the perfect cup of chai.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Customize:</strong> Improve your cart, tools, and decorations to serve faster and earn more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Culture:</strong> Experience the vibrant soundscape of the bazaar \u2014 whistling kettles, clinking cups, and regional tunes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Locals:</strong> Every customer has personality \u2014 from tourists and kids to chatty elders and busy merchants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultural Celebration:</strong> Authentic art and music inspired by Middle Eastern tradition and hospitality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re chasing high scores, collecting beautiful tea sets, or simply soaking in the ambiance of a living bazaar, <i>Istikan Chai</i> offers a heartfelt and flavorful journey brewed with charm, speed, and tradition.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037010?t=1762092260","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037010/0c27e242d883897583ec4ebda0101b3ef385c78e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762092260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037010/67c6c7273c47a254fde38397c6a66c9cd8ac5c86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762092260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037010/67c6c7273c47a254fde38397c6a66c9cd8ac5c86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762092260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2615 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Istikan Chai</strong>, a heartwarming and fast-paced simulation game that celebrates the charm of Middle Eastern street life. You play as a cheerful <strong>ChaiChe</strong>, brewing and serving fragrant tea to a stream of lively customers in colorful bazaar settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a new rush \u2014 drag, pour, and serve before your customers lose patience! As you earn coins, upgrade your cart, unlock stylish tea sets, and decorate your stand with authentic Middle Eastern flair. From the morning markets to the glowing night souks, every location is hand-crafted to capture the warmth, chaos, and rhythm of real street chai culture.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve &amp; Satisfy:</strong> Master quick, intuitive drag-and-drop controls to prepare the perfect cup of chai.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Customize:</strong> Improve your cart, tools, and decorations to serve faster and earn more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragr